 range from the parent count as empty.",[308,348,350],{"id":349},"narrow-containers","Narrow containers",[281,352,353],{},"When the container is too narrow for both the years and months inputs, it switches to a single \"total months\" input; with enough width it goes back to both inputs, keeping any input not yet committed.",[323,355],{"name":356},"months-compact",[308,358,360],{"id":359},"variants","Variants",[281,362,363,364,291,367,370,371,374],{},"Uses the ",[284,365,366],{},"color",[284,368,369],{},"highlight"," of ",[284,372,373],{},"UInput",", applied to every input.",[323,376],{"name":377},"months-color",[308,379,381],{"id":380},"size-and-states","Size and states",[281,383,384,385,388],{},"While loading, a spinner shows after the months unit and input is disabled. The year and month units switch with the locale (\"yr\" and \"mo\" in English, \"年\" and \"月\" in Traditional Chinese); their width follows the text, and so does the width needed for the full years and months layout. See ",[297,386,87],{"href":387},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[323,390],{"name":391},"months-states",[303,393,395],{"id":394},"examples","Examples",[308,397,399],{"id":398},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[281,401,402,403,406,407,291,410,413],{},"Bind the total months, use ",[284,404,405],{},"requiredNumber"," for a required field, and check bounds separately with ",[284,408,409],{},"v.minValue",[284,411,412],{},"v.maxValue",".",[323,415],{"name":416},"months-validation",[308,418,420],{"id":419},"binding-only-years-and-months","Binding only years and months",[281,422,423,424,291,426,413],{},"When the API splits seniority into year and month fields, bind only ",[284,425,290],{},[284,427,294],{},[323,429],{"name":430},"months-year-month",[303,432,300],{"id":300},[434,435,436,451],"table",{},[437,438,439],"thead",{},[440,441,442,445,448],"tr",{},[443,444,300],"th",{},[443,446,447],{},"Type",[443,449,450],{},"Descriptio